  "job_B3.3.32_20251003_114718": {
    "chunk_text": "SPEL BE PETRUS & PAULUS. MEN \u00f0a leofestan, weor\u00f0ian we on \u00f0issum andweardan d\u00e6ge Sancte Petres Cristes apostola Apostoles, se is o\u00feer cyricean hyrde to Cristes handa, o\u00feer is hire lareow. O\u00feer is, ic cwe\u00fee, se \u00e6resta apostol, o\u00feer se nehsta; Petrus \u00e6r Cristes \u00ferowunga, & Paulus \u00e6fter his Swa him Drihten Crist, eallum rihtgelyfdum mannum wunigendum for his noman, & Ac Godes Gast eowres F\u00e6der se sprece\u00fe on eow. \u00deonne l\u00e6we\u00fe bro\u00feer o\u00feerne h\u00e6\u00fenum on dea\u00fe, & sunu se l\u00e6we\u00fe his f\u00e6der, & \u00fea gingran arisa\u00fe wi\u00fe Swa hwylc \u00feonne so\u00felice swa on elne & on mines noman andetnesse o\u00fe his ende wuna\u00f0, se bi\u00fe hal & Men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feonne \u00feurhwunodan hie f\u00e6stlice \u00e6fter Cristes bebodum on his lufon & geleafan o\u00fe \u00dea woldan hie on ecnesse h\u00e6le & trume wi\u00f0 deofla ni\u00feum & helle witum, & wundorlice dea\u00fe Folcum swa we nu gehyran magan, men \u00fea leofestan, heora \u00ferowunga, hu hie wi\u00fe Simone \u00fe\u00e6m dry & for Godes naman andetnesse Petrus w\u00e6s on rode gef\u00e6stnod, & him \u00fe\u00e6t heafod w\u00e6s adune gewended & \u00fea hie to samne incoman, he him rehte hu myccle scipbrocu he gebad on \u00fe\u00e6m si\u00fee \u00fee he hie sohte, & \u00dea gesamnodan hie heora weorod wi\u00fe Simone \u00fe\u00e6m dry, & hie",
